[00:02.075]Sometimes I can't help but feel like I don't belong here
{"有时我忍不住觉得自己不属于这里"}
[00:09.608]Out of place, out of mind, like all the time
{"格格不入 恍若隔世 仿佛每时每刻"}
[00:13.887]There's nothing else that feels like is meant for me
{"再没有什么事物让我觉得属于我"}
[00:20.126]But I've got a sweet escape
{"但我找到了甜蜜的避风港"}
[00:23.166]Under bright lights
{"在璀璨灯光下"}
[00:26.654]Illuminate my face
{"照亮我的脸庞"}
[00:28.730]Under bright lights
{"在璀璨灯光下"}
[00:32.155]It's shining down on us
{"光芒洒落我们身上"}
